      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Kannada for a rail track, then the Kannada for to reach."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ವಿಳಂಬ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಳಂಬ — viḷamba — \"a delay\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಳೆಯ ಕಾರಣ ರೈಲು ಎರಡು ಗಂಟೆ ವಿಳಂಬವಾಯಿತು. maḷeya kāraṇa railu eraḍu gaṇṭe viḷambavāyitu. Because of the rain the train was two hours late."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "With ಆಗು it says that something ran late: ವಿಳಂಬವಾಯಿತು, it was delayed. In speech people say ತಡವಾಯಿತು."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಳಂಬ (viḷamba) is borrowed from Sanskrit vilamba, \"delay\" (CDIAL 11890), from the root lamb, \"to hang down, to lag behind\". Kannada writes its l as ಳ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "viḷamba",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *viḷamba*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "viḷamba, once more",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *viḷamba*, once more]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "maḷeya kāraṇa railu eraḍu gaṇṭe viḷambavāyitu. — Because of the rain the train was two hours late.",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *maḷeya kāraṇa railu eraḍu gaṇṭe viḷambavāyitu.* — Because of the rain the train was two hours late.]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say the Kannada for a rail track, then the Kannada for to reach, then say viḷamba again",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say the Kannada for a rail track, then the Kannada for to reach, then say *viḷamba* again]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does ವಿಳಂಬ (viḷamba) mean? (\"A delay\".) Say it once more."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
