          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಿಲುಗಡೆ (nilugaḍe) is a native Kannada noun built on nil, nilu, \"to stand, to stop\" (DEDR 3675). Where the ending -gaḍe comes from is not settled."
            }
