              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಚಾರಿಸು — vicārisu — \"to enquire; to ask after\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ನಾನು ನಿಲ್ದಾಣದಲ್ಲಿ ರೈಲಿನ ಸಮಯ ವಿಚಾರಿಸಿದೆ. nānu nildāṇadalli railina samaya vicāriside. I enquired about the train times at the station."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ವಿಚಾರಿಸಿದೆ, vicāriside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is asked about takes -ಅನ್ನು or no ending; ಆರೋಗ್ಯ ವಿಚಾರಿಸು (vicārisu), to ask after someone's health."
            }
          ]
        },
