          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಿಚಾರಿಸು (vicārisu) is built from Sanskrit vicāra, \"deliberation, examination, investigation\" (Monier-Williams), with the verb ending -isu. The noun ವಿಚಾರ, an idea or a matter, comes from the same Sanskrit word."
            }
          ]
